              <li>Registration: <span class="text-muted"><s>September 17, 2026 (extended)</s></span></li>
              <li>Submission: <span class="text-muted"><s>September 17, 2026</s></span></li>
              <li>Notification: <span class="text-muted">October 24, 2026</span></li>
